ion: \"what needs my attention\" (implies searching for important, unread, or high-priority items).\n\nThe available tools are:\n*   `aggregateInbox`: Fetches recent emails from EVERY connected mailbox. This is ideal for a quick, general overview of what''s incoming/needs attention. It has a `perMailbox` limit.\n*   `searchMail`: Searches connected mailboxes for specific queries. I could use this with a query like \"unread important\" and specify the time frame, but `aggregateInbox` is better for a general \"what needs my attention\" view.\n\nSince the user is asking for a general overview of things needing attention across all mailboxes, `aggregateInbox` is the most direct and efficient tool to start with. The `perMailbox` parameter determines how many emails to fetch from *each* mailbox. Since the user didn''t specify a number, I''ll choose a reasonable default (e.g., 5) to ensure a good summary without overwhelming the output.\n\nI will call `aggregateInbox` to gather the data."}],"createdAt":1793273053184},{"type":"tool-invocation","toolInvocation":{"state":"result","result":{"mailboxes":1,"count":5,"emails":[{"mailboxId":"2509b3b7-2ea9-5861-9415-92dd8cc89134","mailbox":"ana@demo.trymetis.email","id":"WyJJTkJPWCIsIjEwMDAiLDQxMF0","threadId":"<1yyu9x3zlnnu3ni6@kestrelsupply.com>","from":"Kestrel Supply Co.","subject":"This week at the shop","date":"Sat Sep 26 2026 08:00:00 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time)","isRead":true,"isStarred":false,"snippet":""},{"mailboxId":"2509b3b7-2ea9-5861-9415-92dd8cc89134","mailbox":"ana@demo.trymetis.email","id":"WyJJTkJPWCIsIjEwMDAiLDQwOV0","threadId":"<9gjwjjdzcm5nb1e@konkanbank.in>","from":"Konkan Bank","subject":"INR 1,250.00 debited from a/c **4821","date":"Fri Sep 25 2026 04:10:00 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time)","isRead":true,"isStarred":false,"snippet":""},{"mailboxId":"2509b3b7-2ea9-5861-9415-92dd8cc89134","mailbox":"ana@demo.trymetis.email","id":"WyJJTkJPWCIsIjEwMDAiLDQwOF0","threadId":"<3qdqvowjoh7xq07e@demo.tr