gned proposal.\n\nThree bullets. Let me craft.","details":[{"type":"text","text":"Now summarize in three bullet points. The brief: Aozora Ceramics rebrand prepared for Fernhill Studio by Kenji Watanabe. Audience: design-led cafes, restaurants, home cooks in Japan and Europe. Deliverables: wordmark and mark three options at first review; colour and type system; packaging for mugs, plates, gift box. Timeline: kickoff Oct 5, first review Oct 8 15:00 UTC, final files Nov 20. Note: keep colour blue (on every Aozora cup since 1962). Budget JPY 1,850,000 agreed in signed proposal.\n\nThree bullets. Let me craft."}],"createdAt":1793273062315},{"type":"text","text":"**Aozora Ceramics rebrand — brief.md** (prepared for Fernhill Studio by Kenji Watanabe, Aozora''s brand manager):\n\n- **Who it''s for:** Design-led cafés, restaurants and home cooks across **Japan and Europe**.\n- **What''s being delivered:** A wordmark and mark (**three options at the first review**), a **colour and type system**, and **packaging** for mugs, plates and the gift box.\n- **Timeline & terms:** Kickoff **Oct 5, 2026**, first review **Oct 8, 15:00 UTC**, final files **Nov 20, 2026** — budget **JPY 1,850,000** per the signed proposal, with the standing rule to **keep blue somewhere in the palette** (it''s been on every Aozora cup since 1962).","createdAt":1793273062315}],"metadata":{"modelId":"deepseek/deepseek-v4.1-flash:floor","provider":"openai-compatible.chat"},"content":"**Aozora Ceramics rebrand — brief.md** (prepared for Fernhill Studio by Kenji Watanabe, Aozora''s brand manager):\n\n- **Who it''s for:** Design-led cafés, restaurants and home cooks across **Japan and Europe**.\n- **What''s being delivered:** A wordmark and mark (**three options at the first review**), a **colour and type system**, and **packaging** for mugs, plates and the gift box.\n- **Timeline & terms:** Kickoff **Oct 5, 2026**, first review **Oct 8, 15:00 UTC**, final files **Nov 20, 2026** — budget **JPY 1,850,000** per the signed proposal, with the standing rule to **keep blue somewhere in the palette** (it''s been on every Aozora cup since 1962)."}','assistant','v2','2026-10-29T11:24:21.503Z','f0c4be98-b2fd-59d7-b11e-c921e7d22615');
