rightloom.\n- **Stated ETA:** **by September 30, 2026** — that''s now **29 days ago**.\n- **Tracking number:** none in the email. The body only says \"Track your package\" with a link and no reference number, so there''s nothing to look up by number.\n- **Follow-ups:** none. The thread has exactly one message (the shipped notice from Sep 23) — no \"out for delivery,\" no \"delivered,\" and no \"delayed\" notice from Swiftpost for A-42. (The Aug 4 delivered/out-for-delivery emails were for the earlier order A-38.)\n\nSo the situation is: **it supposedly shipped a month ago, was due Sep 30, and then went silent** — no tracking number, no delivery scan, no delay notice. That''s a gap worth chasing with Swiftpost or Brightloom.\n\nWant me to draft a follow-up email to Brightloom asking for the tracking number and status of A-42?","createdAt":1793273066118}],"metadata":{"modelId":"deepseek/deepseek-v4.1-flash:floor","provider":"openai-compatible.chat"},"content":"Here''s the tracking picture for **order A-42 (walnut desk lamp)**:\n\n- **Carrier:** Swiftpost, **shipped Sep 23, 2026** from Brightloom.\n- **Stated ETA:** **by September 30, 2026** — that''s now **29 days ago**.\n- **Tracking number:** none in the email. The body only says \"Track your package\" with a link and no reference number, so there''s nothing to look up by number.\n- **Follow-ups:** none. The thread has exactly one message (the shipped notice from Sep 23) — no \"out for delivery,\" no \"delivered,\" and no \"delayed\" notice from Swiftpost for A-42. (The Aug 4 delivered/out-for-delivery emails were for the earlier order A-38.)\n\nSo the situation is: **it supposedly shipped a month ago, was due Sep 30, and then went silent** — no tracking number, no delivery scan, no delay notice. That''s a gap worth chasing with Swiftpost or Brightloom.\n\nWant me to draft a follow-up email to Brightloom asking for the tracking number and status of A-42?"}','assistant','v2','2026-10-29T11:24:26.055Z','f0c4be98-b2fd-