hem would give payee names. Let me get Sep 25 and Sep 12. But that adds a turn. The user asked a question; better to answer well. I''ll fetch the two most recent debit emails.\n\nHmm, but I should just answer. Yet payee detail matters a lot (\"money moving out\" — to whom?). Let me fetch Sep 25 and Sep 12 bodies in parallel."}],"createdAt":1793273071853},{"type":"tool-invocation","toolInvocation":{"state":"result","result":{"id":"WyJJTkJPWCIsIjEwMDAiLDQwOV0","from":"Konkan Bank","to":["ana@demo.trymetis.email"],"subject":"INR 1,250.00 debited from a/c **4821","date":"Fri Sep 25 2026 04:10:00 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time)","hasContent":true,"body":"Dear Customer, INR 1250.00 has been debited from account **4821 to\r\nVPA chaiwala.store@konkan on 25-09-26. UPI Ref 427311009876.\r\nAvailable balance: INR 48,210.55.\r\nNot you? Call 1800 266 4821 to block your account."},"toolCallId":"call-2018039c-f5b5-4fa0-a388-2f740b43438d","toolName":"getEmail","args":{"mailboxId":"2509b3b7-2ea9-5861-9415-92dd8cc89134","id":"WyJJTkJPWCIsIjEwMDAiLDQwOV0"}},"updatedAt":1793273071863},{"type":"tool-invocation","toolInvocation":{"state":"result","result":{"id":"WyJJTkJPWCIsIjEwMDAiLDM5MV0","from":"Konkan Bank","to":["ana@demo.trymetis.email"],"subject":"INR 450.00 debited from a/c **4821","date":"Sat Sep 12 2026 06:55:00 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time)","hasContent":true,"body":"Dear Customer, INR 450.00 has been debited from account **4821 to\r\nVPA chaiwala.store@konkan on 12-09-26. UPI Ref 427310102947.\r\nAvailable balance: INR 49,460.55.\r\nNot you? Call 1800 266 4821 to block your account."},"toolCallId":"call-a9d1c3f4-01fd-4a6f-8fa5-cb2f2b4209cb","toolName":"getEmail","args":{"mailboxId":"2509b3b7-2ea9-5861-9415-92dd8cc89134","id":"WyJJTkJPWCIsIjEwMDAiLDM5MV0"}},"updatedAt":1793273071863},{"type":"step-start","createdAt":1793273071866,"model":"openai-compatible.chat/deepseek/deepseek-v4.1-flash:floor"},{"type":"reasoning","reasoning":"Both to chaiwala.store@konkan (a UPI merchant — likely a tea/coffee shop). Balance ~48,210.55.\n\nLet me answer: recent outgoing from Konkan Bank a/c **4821. Recent debits all UPI. Latest Sep 25 INR 1,250 to chaiwala.store@konkan, Sep 12 INR 450 same. Balance INR 48,210.55.\n\nAlso note no debit alerts in October (nothing for over a month). Also recurring subscription invoices (Ledgerline monthly, Sep 1 latest; Codeyard annual renewal Feb). And Voltaro Energy \"payment received\" (incoming/outgoing?—\"payment received, thank you\" suggests they received your payment? Or is it a utility sending you payment? \"Payment received, thank you\" from Voltaro Energy — likely confirming your payment to them).\n\nI''ll be clear these are email alerts, not a bank feed.\n\nFormat with headline. Keep concise.","details":[{"type":"text","text":"Both to chaiwala.store@konkan (a UPI merchant — likely a tea/coffee shop). Balance ~48,210.55.\n\nLet me answer: recent outgoing from Konkan Bank a/c **4821. Recent debits all UPI. Latest Sep 25 INR 1,250 to chaiwala.store@konkan, Sep 12 INR 450 same. Balance INR 48,210.55.\n\nAlso note no debit alerts in October (nothing for over a month). Also recurring subscription invoices (Ledgerline monthly, Sep 1 latest; Codeyard annual renewal Feb). And Voltaro Energy \"payment received\" (incoming/outgoing?—\"payment received, thank you\" suggests they received your payment? Or is it a utility sending you payment? \"Payment received, thank you\" from Voltaro Energy — likely confirming your payment to them).\n\nI''ll be clear these are email alerts, not a bank feed.\n\nFormat with headline. Keep concise."}],"createdAt":1793273071960},{"type":"text","text":"**Yes — but only small ones, and nothing in October.** All of this comes from **Konkan Bank alerts in your ana@demo.trymetis.email inbox**; I''m reading email, not a bank feed, so it''s only what was notified.\n\n**Outgoing from a/c **4821 (latest first):**\n- **Sep 25, 2026 — INR 1,250.00** to `chaiwala.store@konkan` (UPI, ref