A recurring bill is missing:** your **Ledgerline** subscription invoices arrived monthly (LL-2025111 on **Sep 1** was the last) — there''s **no Oct 1 invoice**, unlike every prior month back to Oct 2025. Could just be undelivered mail, or the subscription lapsed/changed.\n\nOther recurring outflows visible in email: **Voltaro Energy** \"payment received\" (last Mar 2026) and a **Codeyard Team** annual renewal (Feb 2026).\n\nWant me to open the older debit alerts to see which merchants the Aug/Jun/Apr amounts went to, or check whether the Ledgerline October invoice ever arrived?"}','assistant','v2','2026-10-29T11:24:26.167Z','f0c4be98-b2fd-59d7-b11e-c921e7d22615');
